      "end_ms": 214640,
      "start": "00:03:30.879",
      "end": "00:03:34.640",
      "text": "space is a tool to get a better setup."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 213200,
      "end_ms": 216319,
      "start": "00:03:33.200",
      "end": "00:03:36.319",
      "text": "And it might seem like those two are the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 214640,
      "end_ms": 218000,
      "start": "00:03:34.640",
      "end": "00:03:38.000",
      "text": "same thing, but it's really not. We made"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 216319,
      "end_ms": 219200,
      "start": "00:03:36.319",
      "end": "00:03:39.200",
      "text": "space to the right here. We could have"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 218000,
      "end_ms": 220799,
      "start": "00:03:38.000",
      "end": "00:03:40.799",
      "text": "tried to just engage with blade here,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 219200,
      "end_ms": 222319,
      "start": "00:03:39.200",
      "end": "00:03:42.319",
      "text": "but it probably wouldn't have worked."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 220799,
      "end_ms": 224080,
      "start": "00:03:40.799",
      "end": "00:03:44.080",
      "text": "The backline is really far. They have"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 222319,
      "end_ms": 225280,
      "start": "00:03:42.319",
      "end": "00:03:45.280",
      "text": "lots of tools to live. And proper engage"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 224080,
      "end_ms": 227360,
      "start": "00:03:44.080",
      "end": "00:03:47.360",
      "text": "from here would have just been way worse"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 225280,
      "end_ms": 229280,
      "start": "00:03:45.280",
      "end": "00:03:49.280",
      "text": "than it was from the side. Falcon sees"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 227360,
      "end_ms": 231200,
      "start": "00:03:47.360",
      "end": "00:03:51.200",
      "text": "Ants baiting and backing up even further"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 229280,
      "end_ms": 232799,
      "start": "00:03:49.280",
      "end": "00:03:52.799",
      "text": "and correctly decide that we can get an"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 231200,
      "end_ms": 234480,
      "start": "00:03:51.200",
      "end": "00:03:54.480",
      "text": "even better setup and even more space"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 232799,
      "end_ms": 235760,
      "start": "00:03:52.799",
      "end": "00:03:55.760",
      "text": "off of this. And this is the most"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 234480,
      "end_ms": 237439,
      "start": "00:03:54.480",
      "end": "00:03:57.439",
      "text": "important part of playing an engage"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 235760,
      "end_ms": 239280,
      "start": "00:03:55.760",
      "end": "00:03:59.280",
      "text": "comp. If the enemy team is trying to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 237439,
      "end_ms": 240879,
      "start": "00:03:57.439",
      "end": "00:04:00.879",
      "text": "bait you in, punish them by taking all"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 239280,
      "end_ms": 242319,
      "start": "00:03:59.280",
      "end": "00:04:02.319",
      "text": "of the map that you can't. Don't ever"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 240879,
      "end_ms": 243920,
      "start": "00:04:00.879",
      "end": "00:04:03.920",
      "text": "try to force disengage off of getting a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 242319,
      "end_ms": 246159,
      "start": "00:04:02.319",
      "end": "00:04:06.159",
      "text": "little bit of space. If you look at the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 243920,
      "end_ms": 247920,
      "start": "00:04:03.920",
      "end": "00:04:07.920",
      "text": "spot proper gets to, it's very easy to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 246159,
      "end_ms": 248959,
      "start": "00:04:06.159",
      "end": "00:04:08.959",
      "text": "make this work from here. I know masters"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 247920,
      "end_ms": 251120,
      "start": "00:04:07.920",
      "end": "00:04:11.120",
      "text": "Genjis that could pull off this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 248959,
      "end_ms": 253120,
      "start": "00:04:08.959",
      "end": "00:04:13.120",
      "text": "nanoblade. The difficult part is getting"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 251120,
      "end_ms": 254400,
      "start": "00:04:11.120",
      "end": "00:04:14.400",
      "text": "to this spot. If you're ever watching a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 253120,
      "end_ms": 256000,
      "start": "00:04:13.120",
      "end": "00:04:16.000",
      "text": "VOD and thinking, \"Wow, that looked"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 254400,
      "end_ms": 258000,
      "start": "00:04:14.400",
      "end": "00:04:18.000",
      "text": "pretty easy.\" This is probably what"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 256000,
      "end_ms": 260400,
      "start": "00:04:16.000",
      "end": "00:04:20.400",
      "text": "you're missing. I'm not here to glaze"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 258000,
      "end_ms": 261759,
      "start": "00:04:18.000",
      "end": "00:04:21.759",
      "text": "falcons. I'm here to flame ants. This is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 260400,
      "end_ms": 263520,
      "start": "00:04:20.400",
      "end": "00:04:23.520",
      "text": "where you see the biggest philosophy"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 261759,
      "end_ms": 265600,
      "start": "00:04:21.759",
      "end": "00:04:25.600",
      "text": "difference. What does it mean to lock"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 263520,
      "end_ms": 267199,
      "start": "00:04:23.520",
      "end": "00:04:27.199",
      "text": "eyes and fight? The second you realize"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 265600,
      "end_ms": 268800,
      "start": "00:04:25.600",
      "end": "00:04:28.800",
      "text": "the enemy team is about to get a good"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 267199,
      "end_ms": 270479,
      "start": "00:04:27.199",
      "end": "00:04:30.479",
      "text": "setup, you have to stop them from"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 268800,
      "end_ms": 271919,
      "start": "00:04:28.800",
      "end": "00:04:31.919",
      "text": "getting that good setup. Right around"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 270479,
      "end_ms": 273040,
      "start": "00:04:30.479",
      "end": "00:04:33.040",
      "text": "here, when you see Vesta peeking,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 271919,
      "end_ms": 274720,
      "start": "00:04:31.919",
      "end": "00:04:34.720",
      "text": "there's a couple important things we"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 273040,
      "end_ms": 276240,
      "start": "00:04:33.040",
      "end": "00:04:36.240",
      "text": "know. They just use cool downs to clear"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 274720,
      "end_ms": 278400,
      "start": "00:04:34.720",
      "end": "00:04:38.400",
      "text": "our tracer. The Genji doesn't have"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 276240,
      "end_ms": 280720,
      "start": "00:04:36.240",
      "end": "00:04:40.720",
      "text": "coolowns. The backline is still trying"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 278400,
      "end_ms": 282639,
      "start": "00:04:38.400",
      "end": "00:04:42.639",
      "text": "to walk around to keep up. And we have"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 280720,
      "end_ms": 284000,
      "start": "00:04:40.720",
      "end": "00:04:44.000",
      "text": "TS. Maybe I want to save this flux for"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 282639,
      "end_ms": 285919,
      "start": "00:04:42.639",
      "end": "00:04:45.919",
      "text": "something specific like trying to catch"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 284000,
      "end_ms": 288000,
      "start": "00:04:44.000",
      "end": "00:04:48.000",
      "text": "the blade or trying to live in the cage."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 285919,
      "end_ms": 290000,
      "start": "00:04:45.919",
      "end": "00:04:50.000",
      "text": "But either way, you need to stand your"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 288000,
      "end_ms": 291680,
      "start": "00:04:48.000",
      "end": "00:04:51.680",
      "text": "ground here. No matter how scary it"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 290000,
      "end_ms": 293440,
      "start": "00:04:50.000",
      "end": "00:04:53.440",
      "text": "might seem to stand your ground, it's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 291680,
      "end_ms": 295199,
      "start": "00:04:51.680",
      "end": "00:04:55.199",
      "text": "always better to fight before the enemy"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 293440,
      "end_ms": 296560,
      "start": "00:04:53.440",
      "end": "00:04:56.560",
      "text": "gets a good setup than to let them get a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 295199,
      "end_ms": 297840,
      "start": "00:04:55.199",
      "end": "00:04:57.840",
      "text": "good setup and try to turn around and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 296560,
      "end_ms": 299440,
      "start": "00:04:56.560",
      "end": "00:04:59.440",
      "text": "peel people that are already in your"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 297840,
      "end_ms": 301199,
      "start": "00:04:57.840",
      "end": "00:05:01.199",
      "text": "backline. From this fight, we can learn"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 299440,
      "end_ms": 303199,
      "start": "00:04:59.440",
      "end": "00:05:03.199",
      "text": "a really important lesson. If the enemy"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 301199,
      "end_ms": 304960,
      "start": "00:05:01.199",
      "end": "00:05:04.960",
      "text": "team makes space, you have a very short"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 303199,
      "end_ms": 306479,
      "start": "00:05:03.199",
      "end": "00:05:06.479",
      "text": "window to fight back before they get a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 304960,
      "end_ms": 309120,
      "start": "00:05:04.960",
      "end": "00:05:09.120",
      "text": "good setup and you have no counterplay"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 306479,
      "end_ms": 310240,
      "start": "00:05:06.479",
      "end": "00:05:10.240",
      "text": "left. This is the counterplay window. If"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 309120,
      "end_ms": 312000,
      "start": "00:05:09.120",
      "end": "00:05:12.000",
      "text": "you miss it, you're just going to have"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 310240,
      "end_ms": 313680,
      "start": "00:05:10.240",
      "end": "00:05:13.680",
      "text": "to watch as your whole team dies. Now,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 312000,
      "end_ms": 316400,
      "start": "00:05:12.000",
      "end": "00:05:16.400",
      "text": "let's look at a more recent example."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 313680,
      "end_ms": 317840,
      "start": "00:05:13.680",
      "end": "00:05:17.840",
      "text": "This is an NA OWCS match of GK Esports"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 316400,
      "end_ms": 319360,
      "start": "00:05:16.400",
      "end": "00:05:19.360",
      "text": "versus Team Liquid that happened a few"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 317840,
      "end_ms": 321600,
      "start": "00:05:17.840",
      "end": "00:05:21.600",
      "text": "weeks ago. This fight is a pretty"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 319360,
      "end_ms": 323039,
      "start": "00:05:19.360",
      "end": "00:05:23.039",
      "text": "similar concept where GK only has Blade"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 321600,
      "end_ms": 324639,
      "start": "00:05:21.600",
      "end": "00:05:24.639",
      "text": "and a hard engage tool to try and win"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 323039,
      "end_ms": 326000,
      "start": "00:05:23.039",
      "end": "00:05:26.000",
      "text": "this fight and Liquid is playing a comp"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 324639,
      "end_ms": 327840,
      "start": "00:05:24.639",
      "end": "00:05:27.840",
      "text": "that wants to bait them in and punish"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 326000,
      "end_ms": 329520,
      "start": "00:05:26.000",
      "end": "00:05:29.520",
      "text": "this engage. Also similar to the fight"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 327840,
      "end_ms": 330960,
      "start": "00:05:27.840",
      "end": "00:05:30.960",
      "text": "we just watched, GK is going to go in"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 329520,
      "end_ms": 332320,
      "start": "00:05:29.520",
      "end": "00:05:32.320",
      "text": "and do whatever they want and Liquid's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 330960,
      "end_ms": 333680,
      "start": "00:05:30.960",
      "end": "00:05:33.680",
      "text": "not even going to try and fight back."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 332320,
      "end_ms": 337240,
      "start": "00:05:32.320",
      "end": "00:05:37.240",
      "text": "Let's watch this fight first and then"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 333680,
      "end_ms": 337240,
      "start": "00:05:33.680",
      "end": "00:05:37.240",
      "text": "we'll go back and analyze."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 352720,
      "end_ms": 356320,
      "start": "00:05:52.720",
      "end": "00:05:56.320",
      "text": "So that looked pretty easy. Rupaul never"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 354880,
      "end_ms": 358240,
      "start": "00:05:54.880",
      "end": "00:05:58.240",
      "text": "really had a chance. Nobody stopped"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 356320,
      "end_ms": 359759,
      "start": "00:05:56.320",
      "end": "00:05:59.759",
      "text": "Genji from getting in. It was very easy"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 358240,
      "end_ms": 361840,
      "start": "00:05:58.240",
      "end": "00:06:01.840",
      "text": "to get to space in the setup we needed"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 359759,
      "end_ms": 363280,
      "start": "00:05:59.759",
      "end": "00:06:03.280",
      "text": "to make this kill happen. Now Kuffa did"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 361840,
      "end_ms": 365039,
      "start": "00:06:01.840",
      "end": "00:06:05.039",
      "text": "get traded on the way in due to his own"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 363280,
      "end_ms": 366639,
      "start": "00:06:03.280",
      "end": "00:06:06.639",
      "text": "micro, but that was a personal mistake"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 365039,
      "end_ms": 368960,
      "start": "00:06:05.039",
      "end": "00:06:08.960",
      "text": "and they do come back and clean this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 366639,
      "end_ms": 370800,
      "start": "00:06:06.639",
      "end": "00:06:10.800",
      "text": "fight up anyways. So, what happened? How"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 368960,
      "end_ms": 372160,
      "start": "00:06:08.960",
      "end": "00:06:12.160",
      "text": "do we make space? What kind of setup did"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 370800,
      "end_ms": 374000,
      "start": "00:06:10.800",
      "end": "00:06:14.000",
      "text": "we get out of that space? And how do we"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 372160,
      "end_ms": 375600,
      "start": "00:06:12.160",
      "end": "00:06:15.600",
      "text": "just get this kill so easily? There's a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 374000,
      "end_ms": 377199,
      "start": "00:06:14.000",
      "end": "00:06:17.199",
      "text": "couple things. First of all, there's two"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 375600,
      "end_ms": 379199,
      "start": "00:06:15.600",
      "end": "00:06:19.199",
      "text": "ways to make space and try and get the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 377199,
      "end_ms": 380960,
      "start": "00:06:17.199",
      "end": "00:06:20.960",
      "text": "setup. If we have a cheap bolt we can"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 379199,
      "end_ms": 382479,
      "start": "00:06:19.199",
      "end": "00:06:22.479",
      "text": "use, like noon or window, we can just"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 380960,
      "end_ms": 384479,
      "start": "00:06:20.960",
      "end": "00:06:24.479",
      "text": "pop one of these, get all the space, and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 382479,
      "end_ms": 385919,
      "start": "00:06:22.479",
      "end": "00:06:25.919",
      "text": "then set up after that. If we don't, we"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 384479,
      "end_ms": 387360,
      "start": "00:06:24.479",
      "end": "00:06:27.360",
      "text": "need really good swing timing and we"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 385919,
      "end_ms": 389440,
      "start": "00:06:25.919",
      "end": "00:06:29.440",
      "text": "need to probably use our tank CDs and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 387360,
      "end_ms": 391039,
      "start": "00:06:27.360",
      "end": "00:06:31.039",
      "text": "push with them. If you watch Kuffa, he"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 389440,
      "end_ms": 393520,
      "start": "00:06:29.440",
      "end": "00:06:33.520",
      "text": "jumps to the right, makes a little bit"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 391039,
      "end_ms": 395759,
      "start": "00:06:31.039",
      "end": "00:06:35.759",
      "text": "of space, and he walls to cut the Orisa"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 393520,
      "end_ms": 397360,
      "start": "00:06:33.520",
      "end": "00:06:37.360",
      "text": "off from his own backline. This is going"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 395759,
      "end_ms": 400319,
      "start": "00:06:35.759",
      "end": "00:06:40.319",
      "text": "to allow Mayon to reach for the setup"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 397360,
      "end_ms": 401840,
      "start": "00:06:37.360",
      "end": "00:06:41.840",
      "text": "that's going to let him blade."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 400319,
      "end_ms": 403440,
      "start": "00:06:40.319",
      "end": "00:06:43.440",
      "text": "He wall climbs off this wall. Nice"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 401840,
      "end_ms": 405039,
      "start": "00:06:41.840",
      "end": "00:06:45.039",
      "text": "little piece of micro, by the way. And"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 403440,
      "end_ms": 407280,
      "start": "00:06:43.440",
      "end": "00:06:47.280",
      "text": "his team is able to hard swing behind"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 405039,
      "end_ms": 408880,
      "start": "00:06:45.039",
      "end": "00:06:48.880",
      "text": "him, especially the cast in the back to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 407280,
      "end_ms": 411120,
      "start": "00:06:47.280",
      "end": "00:06:51.120",
      "text": "punish anybody that tries to shoot the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 408880,
      "end_ms": 412880,
      "start": "00:06:48.880",
      "end": "00:06:52.880",
      "text": "Genji and also to hard pocket him. So,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 411120,
      "end_ms": 414800,
      "start": "00:06:51.120",
      "end": "00:06:54.800",
      "text": "this setup was good, but again, I'm not"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 412880,
      "end_ms": 416720,
      "start": "00:06:52.880",
      "end": "00:06:56.720",
      "text": "here to glaze GK. I'm here to flame"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 414800,
      "end_ms": 418000,
      "start": "00:06:54.800",
      "end": "00:06:58.000",
      "text": "Liquid. Where exactly was the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 416720,
      "end_ms": 420160,
      "start": "00:06:56.720",
      "end": "00:07:00.160",
      "text": "counterplay that we missed for this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 418000,
      "end_ms": 422800,
      "start": "00:06:58.000",
      "end": "00:07:02.800",
      "text": "engage? Well, all we have is Torbull and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 420160,
      "end_ms": 424639,
      "start": "00:07:00.160",
      "end": "00:07:04.639",
      "text": "some CDs. Now, these are very strong"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 422800,
      "end_ms": 426639,
      "start": "00:07:02.800",
      "end": "00:07:06.639",
      "text": "CDs, so there's no excuse for it to not"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 424639,
      "end_ms": 427840,
      "start": "00:07:04.639",
      "end": "00:07:07.840",
      "text": "be enough to fight back in this neutral."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 426639,
      "end_ms": 431479,
      "start": "00:07:06.639",
      "end": "00:07:11.479",
      "text": "Let's watch this fight really quickly"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 427840,
      "end_ms": 431479,
      "start": "00:07:07.840",
      "end": "00:07:11.479",
      "text": "from Zer's perspective."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 443440,
      "end_ms": 446639,
      "start": "00:07:23.440",
      "end": "00:07:26.639",
      "text": "Can you pinpoint the moment that GK"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 445440,
      "end_ms": 448479,
      "start": "00:07:25.440",
      "end": "00:07:28.479",
      "text": "starts to reach for space and their"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 446639,
      "end_ms": 449759,
      "start": "00:07:26.639",
      "end": "00:07:29.759",
      "text": "setup starts to become good? This is the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 448479,
      "end_ms": 454120,
      "start": "00:07:28.479",
      "end": "00:07:34.120",
      "text": "moment we need to start pushing with our"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 449759,
      "end_ms": 454120,
      "start": "00:07:29.759",
      "end": "00:07:34.120",
      "text": "CDs and probably use our old."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 460000,
      "end_ms": 464000,
      "start": "00:07:40.000",
      "end": "00:07:44.000",
      "text": "Did you catch the moment that Liquid"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 461360,
      "end_ms": 465840,
      "start": "00:07:41.360",
      "end": "00:07:45.840",
      "text": "missed? It's right around here. You can"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 464000,
      "end_ms": 467360,
      "start": "00:07:44.000",
      "end": "00:07:47.360",
      "text": "see Kuff is starting to set up. The wall"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 465840,
      "end_ms": 469120,
      "start": "00:07:45.840",
      "end": "00:07:49.120",
      "text": "is about to come out. And also, this is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 467360,
      "end_ms": 470720,
      "start": "00:07:47.360",
      "end": "00:07:50.720",
      "text": "a very big and important cool down."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 469120,
      "end_ms": 472319,
      "start": "00:07:49.120",
      "end": "00:07:52.319",
      "text": "There's no reason we're not able to push"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 470720,
      "end_ms": 473840,
      "start": "00:07:50.720",
      "end": "00:07:53.840",
      "text": "here. Start to zone back liners and make"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 472319,
      "end_ms": 475840,
      "start": "00:07:52.319",
      "end": "00:07:55.840",
      "text": "sure this Genji can't set up for his"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 473840,
      "end_ms": 477520,
      "start": "00:07:53.840",
      "end": "00:07:57.520",
      "text": "blade. If you need to use this ult,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 475840,
      "end_ms": 478879,
      "start": "00:07:55.840",
      "end": "00:07:58.879",
      "text": "that's totally fine. You're going to be"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 477520,
      "end_ms": 480479,
      "start": "00:07:57.520",
      "end": "00:08:00.479",
      "text": "able to turn around for this hazard."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 478879,
      "end_ms": 482080,
      "start": "00:07:58.879",
      "end": "00:08:02.080",
      "text": "Maybe he'll get gripped out, but you'll"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 480479,
      "end_ms": 484160,
      "start": "00:08:00.479",
      "end": "00:08:04.160",
      "text": "get to keep all the space on the map and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 482080,
      "end_ms": 485919,
      "start": "00:08:02.080",
      "end": "00:08:05.919",
      "text": "this blade will be impossible to set up."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 484160,
      "end_ms": 487599,
      "start": "00:08:04.160",
      "end": "00:08:07.599",
      "text": "Watching people set up engages in front"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 485919,
      "end_ms": 489280,
      "start": "00:08:05.919",
      "end": "00:08:09.280",
      "text": "of you and not fighting back for this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 487599,
      "end_ms": 492319,
      "start": "00:08:07.599",
      "end": "00:08:12.319",
      "text": "space is exactly what Rush is calling"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 489280,
      "end_ms": 494960,
      "start": "00:08:09.280",
      "end": "00:08:14.960",
      "text": "you not manly for. You've locked eyes."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 492319,
      "end_ms": 496560,
      "start": "00:08:12.319",
      "end": "00:08:16.560",
      "text": "Now it's time to fight."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 494960,
      "end_ms": 498240,
      "start": "00:08:14.960",
      "end": "00:08:18.240",
      "text": "The only reason this fight is close at"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 496560,
      "end_ms": 499680,
      "start": "00:08:16.560",
      "end": "00:08:19.680",
      "text": "all is because Kuff decides he feels"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 498240,
      "end_ms": 501440,
      "start": "00:08:18.240",
      "end": "00:08:21.440",
      "text": "like dying instead of jumping back to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 499680,
      "end_ms": 503520,
      "start": "00:08:19.680",
      "end": "00:08:23.520",
      "text": "his team."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 501440,
      "end_ms": 504960,
      "start": "00:08:21.440",
      "end": "00:08:24.960",
      "text": "Here he has jump is 300 health and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 503520,
      "end_ms": 506400,
      "start": "00:08:23.520",
      "end": "00:08:26.400",
      "text": "decides to just watch everybody on the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 504960,
      "end_ms": 508800,
      "start": "00:08:24.960",
      "end": "00:08:28.800",
      "text": "enemy team shoot him to death instead of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 506400,
      "end_ms": 511039,
      "start": "00:08:26.400",
      "end": "00:08:31.039",
      "text": "leaving. If Kuffa hadn't donated this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 508800,
      "end_ms": 512959,
      "start": "00:08:28.800",
      "end": "00:08:32.959",
      "text": "generous miracle pick for you guys, this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 511039,
      "end_ms": 514880,
      "start": "00:08:31.039",
      "end": "00:08:34.880",
      "text": "would have been a horrible stomp on the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 512959,
      "end_ms": 517599,
      "start": "00:08:32.959",
      "end": "00:08:37.599",
      "text": "end of circuit and I don't want to watch"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 514880,
      "end_ms": 519360,
      "start": "00:08:34.880",
      "end": "00:08:39.360",
      "text": "this anymore. Please, Western teams,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 517599,
      "end_ms": 521039,
      "start": "00:08:37.599",
      "end": "00:08:41.039",
      "text": "start fighting back in your neutrals and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 519360,
      "end_ms": 523440,
      "start": "00:08:39.360",
      "end": "00:08:43.440",
      "text": "stop watching people set up in front of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 521039,
      "end_ms": 525919,
      "start": "00:08:41.039",
      "end": "00:08:45.919",
      "text": "you. If you lock eyes, it's time to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 523440,
      "end_ms": 525919,
      "start": "00:08:43.440",
      "end": "00:08:45.919",
      "text": "fight."
    }
  ]
}
